# Ureni, the Song Unending: "it deals X damage divided as you choose among any number of target creatures and/or planeswalkers your
# opponents control, where X is the number of lands you control" (CR 601.2d, 120.3). Bot1 casts Ureni on turn 3 (Mox Ruby, Mox Sapphire,
# Mox Emerald, Sol Ring, Black Lotus) with two lands, so X is 2: one damage to Bot2's Memnite, which dies, and one to Ornithopter (0/2),
# which survives with the damage marked.

